    "title": "Sweet treats for Valentine's Day at Dairy Dreem - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Carlos Mathis ,\n9 hours ago\nMORAINE, Ohio ( WDTN ) — If you’re looking for a sweet treat for your special someone for Valentine’s Day, you may consider supporting a local dessert shop.\nDixie Dairy Dreem in Moraine and Dairy Dreem in Kettering are offering special Valentine’s Day menu items, ranging from single-serve items to cakes.\nSingle-serve items Valentine’s Day cupcakes at Dairy Dreem | Carlos Mathis/WDTN Photo A cupcake is one of several items customers can choose from in the Valentine’s Day menu. It consists of chocolate and vanilla soft serve, crunch hot fudge, whipped cream and sprinkles.\nAdditional holiday items include the Be Mine Parfait, Cupid’s Arrow Arctic Swirl/Shake, Pink Perfection Arctic, Sweetheart Sundae and Strawberry Soft Serve.\nPatrons looking for just soft serve and Dole Whip options that are red or pink may consider items like Strawberry Soft Serve, Party Animal and Raspberry Dole Whip.\nValentine’s Day offerings at Dairy Dreem | Carlos Mathis/WDTN Photo Valentine’s Day offerings at Dairy Dreem | Carlos Mathis/WDTN Photo Valentine’s Day offerings at Dairy Dreem | Carlos Mathis/WDTN Photo Valentine’s Day offerings at Dairy Dreem | Carlos Mathis/WDTN Photo Valentine’s Day offerings at Dairy Dreem | Carlos Mathis/WDTN Photo Valentine’s Day Decor | Carlos Mathis/WDTN Photo Cakes At the Kettering location, patrons can choose from cakes in the cake cooler.\nMackenzie Landis, general manager of Dairy Dreem, explained the shop is offering eight-inch, 10-inch and heart cakes.\nCakes at Dairy Dreem | Carlos Mathis/WDTN Photo Cakes at Dairy Dreem | Carlos Mathis/WDTN Photo Cakes at Dairy Dreem | Carlos Mathis/WDTN Photo Custom cakes are available for occasions like birthdays, but the business asks for a 1-day notice to get the cake ready.\n“If you needed like a special cake for a loved one or birthdays or anything, I would just need like a day in advance to get the cake ready,” said Landis.\nSpecials and menu Throughout the week, the business offers discounts on both sweet and savory items.\nLandis said one of the most popular deal of the week is its “Weenie Wednesday,” where short hotdogs are just 99 cents each.\n“You can get chili cheese, mustard and onion, and then we also offer kraut, coleslaw, relish,” Landis said. “You can get all of that for 99 cents,” Landis said.\nAdditionally, milkshakes are half-price weekdays from 2-4 p.m., and Thursdays from noon-5 p.m.\nTo view the store’s full menu, click here .\nLocations Dixie Dairy Dreem is located along South Dixie Drive, just across from WDTN studios in Moraine.\nDairy Dreem, the second location, opened at Kettering Towne Center in November 2025 .\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WDTN.com.\n1",
    "summary": "MORAINE, Ohio ( WDTN ) — If you’re looking for a sweet treat for your special someone for Valentine’s Day, you may consider supporting a local dessert shop. It consists of chocolate and vanilla soft serve, crunch hot fudge, whipped cream and sprinkles. Mackenzie Landis, general manager of Dairy Dreem, explained the shop is offering eight-inch, 10-inch and heart cakes. Specials and menu Throughout the week, the business offers discounts on both sweet and savory items. Additionally, milkshakes are half-price weekdays from 2-4 p.m., and Thursdays from noon-5 p.m. To view the store’s full menu, click here .",
